{90}{I keep watch. The prophecy is not yet fulfilled.}{I keep watch. The prophecy is not yet fulfilled.}{}{}{}{}
{91}{What prophecy?}{}{5}{}{150}{}
{92}{You're here because you're dead, man.}{}{5}{}{120}{}
{93}{What prophecy?}{}{-4}{}{150}{}
{94}{You are here because you dead, mister king.}{}{-4}{}{120}{}

{120}{You think you teach me that? I'm not crazy yet, my dear.}{You think you teach me that? I'm not crazy yet, my dear.}{}{}{}{}
{121}{Tell me about the prophecy, sire.}{}{5}{}{150}{}
{122}{What prophecy, mister king?}{}{-4}{}{150}{}

{150}{Long ago, the prophet revealed to us that we would be liberated by the sacrifice of a soul, a stranger to the village. According to his prediction, I decided to periodically sacrifice a foreigner who was passing by...}{Long ago, the prophet revealed to us that we would be liberated by the sacrifice of a soul, a stranger to the village. According to his prediction, I decided to periodically sacrifice a foreigner who was passing by...}{}{}{}{}
{151}{[Next]}{}{1}{}{160}{}

{160}{...Our hands were soon covered with innocent blood and mind began to flee many of us, plunging some into trances of furious madness...}{...Our hands were soon covered with innocent blood and mind began to flee many of us, plunging some into trances of furious madness...}{}{}{}{}
{161}{[Next]}{}{1}{}{170}{}

{170}{Since then, madness has spread among us, like a virus that was going to contaminate us all and worse... contaminate the entire Arcanum continent. Then I resolve to exile us to this remote place... The Valley of the Exiles...}{Since then, madness has spread among us, like a virus that was going to contaminate us all and worse... contaminate the entire Arcanum continent. Then I resolve to exile us to this remote place... The Valley of the Exiles...}{}{}{}{}
{171}{[Next]}{}{1}{}{180}{}

{180}{The Boutchiks are all dead today. But, as if the curse continued after death, we are still trapped in this world, in a state of spectre, without ever being able to find the rest of the soul...}{The Boutchiks are all dead today. But, as if the curse continued after death, we are still trapped in this world, in a state of spectre, without ever being able to find the rest of the soul...}{}{}{}{}
{181}{Where does that gate behind you lead?}{}{5}{}{190}{}
{182}{This gate behind, where to, mister king?}{}{-4}{}{190}{}


{190}{Behind this gate lies a maze from which no one has ever come out. Who knows if there is only an exit to the outside world?... The only thing I'm sure of is that it is impossible to get out without offering a sacrifice to the Executioner. A life saved for a life sacrificed.}{Behind this gate lies a maze from which no one has ever come out. Who knows if there is only an exit to the outside world?... The only thing I'm sure of is that it is impossible to get out without offering a sacrifice to the Executioner. A life saved for a life sacrificed.}{}{}{}{}
{191}{So you don't have enough of these sacrifices?!}{}{5}{}{210}{}
{192}{So many sacrifices! Not enough for you?!}{}{-4}{}{210}{}
{193}{I'll conquer the Executioner.}{}{5}{}{240}{}
{194}{@pcname@ kill Executioner.}{}{-4}{}{240}{}

{210}{I still believe in the prophecy, despite everything... Here. This is the Sacrificial Necklace. He who carries it before the Executioner shall be appointed for the sacrifice.}{I still believe in the prophecy, despite everything... Here. This is the Sacrificial Necklace. He who carries it before the Executioner shall be appointed for the sacrifice.}{}{}{}{}
